        "## Centroid Affinity Scoring\n",
        "\n",
        "As mentioned before, we started by developing style centroids in our feature space for each class member; Sicillian, New York, and Neapolitan. We calculate a style centroid vector as the mean of each feature vector of the scaled feature set.\n",
        "\n",
        "$$\n",
        "\\mathbf{c}_s = \\frac{1}{\\lvert\\mathcal{D}_s\\rvert} \\sum_{r \\in \\mathcal{D}_s} \\mathbf{x}^{(r)}, \\qquad s \\in \\mathcal{S}\n",
        "$$ {#eq-centroid}\n",
        "\n",
        "Note that this does not give us a realistic formula as the values are scaled representations. Instead, this provides a baseline centroid for each style to futher compare against."
      ],
      "id": "cc7a510f"
    },
